        "uuid": "d9cdf4f1_b77f19d1",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/httpd/RemoteUserUtil.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 67,
      "author": {
        "id": 1006192
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-11T13:58:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought about it, but this is the path used also when the HTTP header authentication isn\u0027t used.\n\nThis method does two things:\na) Extraction of the user from an already authenticated flow\nb) Extraction of the user from an HTTP header\n\nThe issue has been reported against b) and not a); therefore, I\u0027m focusing on this code path.\n\nIn case a), I agree that a misconfigured hardening of the system could also expose a vulnerability there. This is simply a mitigation that cannot replace the system\u0027s hardening.",
      "parentUuid": "b159e6b6_5cc9c378",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 64,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 67,
        "endChar": 0
      },
      "revId": "06adf8df4c44482f6e7e9b76ab4fbb738d0e5e2c",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cfe0a9b0_85e33228",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/httpd/RemoteUserUtil.java",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 72,
      "author": {
        "id": 1072905
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-11T11:26:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The documentation says `auth.httpheaderTrustedNetworks` restricts which IPs may provide HTTP header authentication, but the code only checks trusted networks when loginHeader is `Authorization`.\n\nFor a custom header (i.e. `X-Remote-User`), we are still vulnerable to spoofing.\nIs this intentional? If so can you explain the rationale behind this and update the documentation accordingly?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 70,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 72,
        "endChar": 51
      },
      "revId": "06adf8df4c44482f6e7e9b76ab4fbb738d0e5e2c",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
