        "id": 1072905
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-06-11T11:26:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`SubnetUtils.SubnetInfo.isInRange()` documents that network and broadcast addresses are excluded, unless inclusive-host-count mode is enabled, like:\n\n```\n192.168.1.0, the subnet itself\n192.168.1.255 is, all hosts on that subnet\n```\n\nConsider setting:\n```\nsubnet.setInclusiveHostCount(true);\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 133,
        "startChar": 45,
        "endLine": 133,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "06adf8df4c44482f6e7e9b76ab4fbb738d0e5e2c",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "31d64732_bb6c8e6e",
        "filename": "java/com/google/gerrit/httpd/RemoteUserUtil.java",
